 clared by the venues\; charter milestones beyond 60 days are listed in the
  entries only\, and the individual draft expiries listed here are marked a
 s such: they are not commitments of a venue. Events as declared by the ven
 ues on 2026-10-14\; the rows from 2026-10-22 onwards were checked again on
  2026-10-23\, and the IETF 127 rows were read on the datatracker on 2026-1
 0-26\; check the venue for later changes.
